  "releaseNotes": "OpenAI Realtime adapter for Universal.Operative.Sdk.Realtime. Two connection paths: Model.ConnectAsync (server-mediated WebSocket) and Model.ConnectForCallAsync (SIP passthrough, audio flows directly between the caller and OpenAI). Browser-direct WebRTC isn't implemented. RealtimeSessionOptions.ToolChoice is sent as OpenAI's own tool_choice at connect time; RawSendEvent is a general escape hatch, resolving any client event this adapter can send by its wire type.",
